On a PPC750:

PMC1: 128 event types selectable, 12 used
PCM2:  64 event types selectable, 12 used (the same as PCM1)
PCM3:  32 event types selectable, 16 used (4 same as PCM1/2, 12 unique)
PCM4:  32 event types selectable, 13 used (4 same as PCM1/2/3, 9 unique)

