I had the same problem when trying to update the firmware.  I had to perform
the update to fix an invalid date problem.  Symptoms were solid blue screen
until after reading the floppy drive then screen goes black with the cursor in
the upper left hand corner.

The fix was for me to pull out the ATI All-In-Wonder Pro video card I had
