  the boot flags and the default boot device.  (The MicroVAX 3400
  series does have HELP at the console prompt -- the information you
  seek will be accessable via one of the SHOW commands.)  Look for
  a boot device such as XQA0, you will likely want it to be one of
  your local disk devices.  Your boot flags will likely be set to 0.

